sequenceDiagram
  actor Officer
  participant API as Endpoint + ClaimCommands
  participant DB as Database
  participant Relay as OutboxDispatcher
  participant Bus as Event bus
  participant H as Handlers
  actor Claimant

  Officer->>API: POST /api/claims/42/approve
  API->>DB: load claim
  API->>API: handler check, state machine, four-eyes check
  API->>DB: ONE SaveChanges: claim, history row, outbox row
  API-->>Officer: 200 with the updated claim
  Note over API,Officer: The officer never waits for notifications or reporting.
  Relay->>DB: unsent rows, oldest first
  Relay->>Bus: publish ClaimApproved (key = 42)
  Relay->>DB: stamp DispatchedAt
  Bus->>H: ClaimApproved
  H->>DB: notification for claimant (unique per event and user)
  H->>DB: recompute exposure bucket for (market, type)
  Claimant->>API: poll notifications (every 4 s)
  API-->>Claimant: "Good news - claim approved for 85,000"
